  "core": "Breakthrough removes what no longer holds. At Creation, the threshold where what has formed passes into the world, Breakthrough operates on the structure of emergence itself—the breaking that lets a thing leave its making and stand. When this breaking goes unnamed, the form departs clean and the rupture stays invisible. The passage happens; no one marks what broke to let it through.",
